cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. A journal
  article describing the platform is in preparation; this file will be updated
  with the article's citation on acceptance.
type: software
title: Epicurrents platform
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted platform for storing, viewing, annotating and sharing
  neurophysiological signal recordings, with content-addressed immutable
  storage, an audited access model, de-identifying export middleware and
  virtual private network federation between instances.
authors:
  - family-names: Lohi
    given-names: Sampsa
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/epicurrents/platform
url: https://docs.epicurrents.io
keywords:
  - EEG
  - neurophysiology
  - EDF
  - biosignals
